        "body": "<!-- proofline:finding-series=01a202cc-04ff-771e-8dbc-22ef2344f2d8 -->\n**Warning** \u00b7 History skips deliveries that tie at a page boundary\n\nHistory sorts by `scheduled_at` and `id`, but its cursor stores only `scheduled_at`, so the next page excludes every row tied with the last returned delivery.\n\nOperators miss deliveries when a page ends midway through a group scheduled for the same second.\n\nEncode both `scheduled_at` and `id` in the cursor and resume using the same descending sort order.\n\n[View finding in Proofline](https://proofline.sh/orgs/by-id/01a202a0-cd61-7684-99bc-53c775b0de50/reviews/01a202cb-0395-75d0-811f-ee8be49f99f5/findings/01a202cc-0503-7205-904a-4a8c266498c1)",
