        "body": "<!-- proofline:finding-series=01a202cc-0502-7202-8c0d-a8c6f5e2a183 -->\n**Warning** \u00b7 First history page scans all deliveries\n\nThis change orders by unindexed `scheduled_at` before applying `LIMIT`; the base could stop after `limit + 1` rows in primary-key order.\n\nFor a small first page over N deliveries, SQLite visits roughly N \u2212 (limit + 1) extra rows and performs sorting work.\n\nAdd a migration creating an index on `deliveries(scheduled_at DESC, id DESC)`.\n\n[View finding in Proofline](https://proofline.sh/orgs/by-id/01a202a0-cd61-7684-99bc-53c775b0de50/reviews/01a202cb-0395-75d0-811f-ee8be49f99f5/findings/01a202cc-050a-75d8-8282-d44231a276b1)",
